# 统一提交时行尾为 LF，避免跨平台 CRLF/LF 噪音导致整文件假 diff
*.rs text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# GitHub 语言统计：非 Rust 代码（数据/资产/查询）不计入，令仓库显示 100% Rust
translations/*.json linguist-vendored
assets/*.json linguist-vendored
assets/*.svg linguist-vendored
assets/icons/*.svg linguist-vendored
assets/images/* linguist-vendored
assets/fonts/* linguist-vendored
assets/icon.rc linguist-vendored
migrations/*.sql linguist-vendored
queries/*.sql linguist-vendored